### Teacher-Student Relationship API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@teacherUserId = 6
@studentUserId = 4

### Link teacher to student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/{{teacherUserId}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentUserId": {{studentUserId}}
}

### Get all students for a teacher
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/{{teacherUserId}}/students

### Get all teachers for a student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/students/{{studentUserId}}/teachers

### Check if teacher is linked to student
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/{{teacherUserId}}/students/{{studentUserId}}/linked

### Unlink teacher from student
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/teachers/{{teacherUserId}}/students/{{studentUserId}}

